--[[
    PawnPal  ♟
    Cute chess assistant for RoChess.
    - HINTS mode: draws an arrow + shows the best move
    - AUTO  mode: clicks the board to play the best move (no remotes)
    - NORMAL / ⚡ BULLET speed: bullet searches briefly and moves instantly
    Uses the game's own engine (ReplicatedStorage.Chess.Bot) at full strength.
    RightShift = show / hide
--]]

